Package: tsproxy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Expose a TCP service to a tailnet
 tsproxy joins a tailnet as its own host and forwards connections it
 receives there to a TCP service reachable from the machine it runs on.
 .
 A systemd user unit, tsproxy@.service, runs one proxy per tailnet host
 name.
